## 4. Multi-Tier Deterministic Safety Architecture

```
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
| Layer 1: MATLAB Vision & Cost Map Lookahead Replanner       |
| • Lookahead horizon: 1.2 meters                            |
| • RRT* / Evasive Tentacle dynamic replanning                |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
                              |
                              v
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
| Layer 2: Main ESP32 Real-Time Hardware AEB Override         |
| • Front sensor < 18 cm OR Diagonal < 12 cm                  |
| • Overrides all MATLAB motor commands to 0 PWM immediately  |
| • Triggers audio-visual alarm buzzer                        |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
                              |
                              v
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
| Layer 3: Serial Heartbeat Watchdog Timeout                  |
| • 1500 ms timeout if USB cable disconnected or MATLAB halts |
| • Automatically engages active motor braking                |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
```
